  "project_description": "A lightweight Drupal module that triggers a POST request to a defined URL when an entity of a specified content type is saved in Drupal.\n\n Back to top \n\n Features \n \n Configurable webhook endpoint \n API key authentication \n Selective content type triggering \n Adjustable crawl depth \n \n Back to top \n\n Requirements \n \n Drupal 9 or higher \n The Key module \n \n Back to top \n\n Installation \n Enable the module via the admin interface or by using Drush drush en page_refresh_webhook .\n\n Back to top \n\n Configuration \n Please refer to the README.md file\n\n Back to top",
